  "details": "Hello im Daniil_KnyaZz and i have some ideas for VR Chat:\n\n1. Ability to add fav avatars/skin to avatar menu (it works like fav worlds)\n\n2. Ability to block user until i want to unblock him (cause when i block somebody and he re join, i can see him)\n\n3. Possibility to increase and decrease volume of users (same as Mic level bar)\n\n4. Possibility to see map size when you click on friend\n\n5. Choise of reason to kick from server (rude nickname, inappropriate behavior, skin that decrease fps or crash the game, earrape, violence, nudity and etc)\n\n6. Markers / Pencils / Pens as instrument for non VR players (or typing message thing above the head)\n\n7. Few emojis like \"?\", \"i dont know\" \"yes\" and \"no\"",
